# Ash Enterprise: 10 - LiveView: Reading Resources

Effort: **medium** — LiveView mechanics, Ash discipline. *You'll feel a LiveView be just another caller of actions, with no special access.*

```elixir
Application.put_env(:ash, :validate_domain_resource_inclusion?, false)
Application.put_env(:ash, :validate_domain_config_inclusion?, false)
Application.put_env(:ash, :default_string_length_count, :codepoints)

Mix.install(
  [
    {:ash, "~> 3.0"},
    {:ash_phoenix, "~> 2.0"},
    {:phoenix_playground, "~> 0.1"},
    # Any `policies` block needs a SAT solver at runtime; without one the
    # first read raises "No SAT solver available".
    {:simple_sat, "~> 0.1"}
  ],
  consolidate_protocols: false
)
```

